From: mscharged-port
Subject: Admit the cut online tournament's trophy natives for the trophy room
Upstream-base: 8b9d92dd88b4c727cc6359ee4cd5ba128cced7b8
Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission; depends on 0284 and 0344.

The trophy room (src/platform/trophy_room.cpp) moves the front end's camera
from the game's online menu to the trophy of the game's cut online
tournament, and back, with the fe_presentation functions NetTournManager
calls: TransitionOnlineMenuToTournament and
TransitionOnlineTournamentToMenu. Retail never runs that tournament, so the
four natives those functions (and the way back from a match,
TransitionOnlineTournamentToGame) call on the tournament's trophy were never
admitted, and the frontend sequence diagnostic's default case threw on the
first of them:

  0  NetTournManager::DetachTournamentTrophy
  3  NetTournManager::DestroyTournamentTrophy
  13 BeginLoadTournamentTrophy (the trophy's .rlt and .rlg, as the
     stadium's models load)
  51 FinishLoadTournamentTrophy once both are loaded, else wait

Under the named MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_TROPHY_ROOM admission, move
those four cases into the admitted set. Case bodies are unchanged; their
callees are already native (the trophy's resource mark is a GLResourceMark
held in a pointer, as DestroyTournamentTrophy gives it back).

diff --git a/src/Game/Render/FrontEndPresentation_interp.cpp b/src/Game/Render/FrontEndPresentation_interp.cpp
--- a/src/Game/Render/FrontEndPresentation_interp.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/Render/FrontEndPresentation_interp.cpp
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@
 {
     switch (function)
     {
-#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE)
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE) || (defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE) && defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_TROPHY_ROOM))
     case 0:
         NetTournManager::Instance()->DetachTournamentTrophy();
         break;
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@
         break;
 
 #endif
-#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE)
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE) || (defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE) && defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_TROPHY_ROOM))
     case 3:
         NetTournManager::Instance()->DestroyTournamentTrophy();
         break;
@@ -147,7 +147,7 @@
     }
 
 #endif
-#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE)
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE) || (defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE) && defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_TROPHY_ROOM))
     case 13:
         BeginLoadTournamentTrophy();
         break;
@@ -574,7 +574,7 @@
     }
 
 #endif
-#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE)
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE) || (defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE) && defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_TROPHY_ROOM))
